    "https://careers.utoledo.edu/jobs/records-management-officer-2-office-of-the-registrar-main-campus-academic-toledo-oh-ohio-united-states": {
      "title": "UToledo Careers",
      "description": "Records Management Officer 2, Office of the Registrar - Main Campus - Academic Toledo, OH, Ohio, United States Back to UToledo Applicant Login My Profile Kiosk mode UToledo Careers Records Management Officer 2, Office of the Registrar 501191 Main Campus - Academic Toledo, OH CWA Full-Time Staff - Full-Time Add to favorites View favorites Title: Records Management Officer 2, Office of the Registrar Department Org: Registrar - 103170 Employee Classification: H3 - Comm Workers of America FT Bargaining Unit: Communication Workers America Primary Location: MC AC Shift: 1 Start Time: End Time: Posted Salary: 19.66 Float: False Rotate: False On Call: False Travel: False Weekend/Holiday: False Job Description: The Records Management Officer 2 is responsible for performing administrative functions, problem solving, auditing, training, and providing student services by maintaining academic records in hard copy or through one or more of the university’s information systems. This position ensures accuracy of records and adherence to all applicable regulations, policies, and procedures. This position performs functions across multiple areas within the Office of the Registrar and impacts frontline customer service, email, enrollment, registration, grading, graduation, records integrity, academics, room and event scheduling, reporting, and imaging. The Records Management Officer 2 can work independently and reports to a designated supervisor. Minimum Qualifications: Education/experience/licensing: • High School Diploma with at least 3-5 years of practical experience with Microsoft Windows, Microsoft Word, Excel, and PowerPoint. Communication and other skills: • Excellent communication and customer service skills, as well as strong organizational skills and attention to detail required. Preferred Qualifications: Experience in a higher education setting preferred. Conditions of Employment: To promote the highest levels of health and well-being, the University of Toledo campuses are tobacco-free. Pre-employment health screening requirements for the University of Toledo Health Science Campus Medical Center will include drug and other required health screenings for the position. Equal Employment Opportunity Statement: The University of Toledo is an equal opportunity employer. The University of Toledo does not discriminate in employment, educational programs, or activities on the basis of race, color, religion, sex, age, ancestry, national origin, sexual orientation, gender identity and expression, military or veteran status, disability, familial status, or political affiliation. The University is dedicated to attracting and retaining the best and brightest talent and fostering a culture of respect. The University of Toledo provides reasonable accommodation to individuals with disabilities. If you require accommodation to complete this application, or for testing or interviewing, please contact HR Compliance at hrcompliance@utoledo.edu or 419-530-4747 between the hours of 8:30 a.m. and 5 p.m. or apply online for an accommodation request. Computer access is available at most public libraries and at the Office of Human Resources located in the Center for Administrative Support on the UToledo Main Campus. Back to job listing Apply Now First Name (required) 32ea82ca Last Name (required) bcdbd634 Email (required) e388575f Refer someone to this job Apply Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Recommended jobs Cardiac Sonographer 2 Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH, Ohio Heart Station - 109070 Cardiac Sonographer 2, Full Time (8:00am - 17:30pm) 5 8's Saturday rotation\nNo Sundays, Call is on rotation, Holiday call is on rotation.\nMay Underfill with Cardiac Sonographer 1. Ekg Technician I Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH, Ohio Heart Station - 109070 EKG Technician I, Part Time, Sunday - Saturday (6:30am - 11:00pm).\nRotate, Weekends/Holidays. Assistant/Associate/Full Professor Health Science Campus College Toledo, O