      "title": "UToledo Careers",
      "description": "Mental Health Tech - Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH, Ohio, United States Back to UToledo Applicant Login My Profile Kiosk mode UToledo Careers Mental Health Tech 501417 Health Science Campus Hospital Toledo, OH AFSCME Healthcare Positions Mental Health Part-Time Show More Show Less Staff - Part-Time Add to favorites View favorites Title: Mental Health Tech Department Org: Kobacker-I/P Nursing Unit - 109520 Employee Classification: B6 - Unclass Part Time AFSCME HSC Bargaining Unit: AFSCME HSC Primary Location: HSC H Shift: 1 Start Time: 6:00 am End Time: 6:30 pm Posted Salary: $19.55 Float: True Rotate: True On Call: False Travel: False Weekend/Holiday: True Job Description: Assists the professional nurse in creating a milieu therapeutic for hospitalized patients with behavioral/emotional disturbance. Minimum Qualifications: Education / Knowledge / Skills / Abilities 1. Graduate from an approved school with an Associate Degree in Mental Health Technology or two years of college in Psychology or related field. 2. BLS required. 3. Demonstrates proficient interviewing techniques and empathic interactions appropriate to the emotional wellbeing of the patient. 4. Ability to plan and organize work and to work under close supervision. Willingness to accept responsibility for patients and their care when performing designated functions of this position. 5. May be required to rotate shifts and units. 6. Physical requirements: a. visual acuity of 20/20 or corrected to 20/20 including color vision when applicable; b. ability to hear (with or without aides); c. ability to orally communicate; d. good manual dexterity; e. ability to push, pull, roll, and transfer/lift 50 pounds occasionally; f. ability to stand, walk frequently; g. ability to bend, reach, stoop, kneel frequently; h. ability to perform CPR; and i. must be able to physically hold and restrain patients. Conditions of Employment: To promote the highest levels of health and well-being, 