h our jobs. Fuel your future. UTMC positions requiring current AHA CPR certification ( Policy 3364-100-50-33 ) must be completed within the orientation period. All Open Positions Current Employees UToledo Bargaining Unit Bidding Clery Act | EEO | Accessibility | Immigration Notices | Applicants have rights under Federal Employment Laws © 2020 THE UNIVERSITY OF TOLEDO • 2801 W. Bancroft St. • Toledo, OH 43606 • 800.586.5336 A - Z List | Careers | Report a Concern | Nondiscrimination | Accessibility | Web Privacy | Feedback | Contact Us Last Updated: 8/20/26"
